{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07471","headline":"送孙逸归庐山 · 刘长卿","name":"送孙逸归庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鑪峰绝顶楚云衔，楚客东归栖此岩。\n彭蠡湖边香橘柚，浔阳郭外暗枫杉。\n青山不断三湘道，飞鸟空随万里帆。\n常爱此中多胜事，新诗他日伫开缄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}